# setuptools puts tests/test_*.py in the sdist on its own, but neither
# conftest.py nor anything the tests read. Without these, an sdist ships a suite
# that cannot run: every golden test errors on a missing fixture, test_pack.py
# packs examples/, and test_docs.py asserts against docs/ and CHANGELOG.md.
include tests/conftest.py
recursive-include examples *
recursive-include docs *.md
include CHANGELOG.md CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md
